body = "Dear Elohim,

Please guide me with your Holy Power, for I have discernment.

Dear Elohim,

Please guide me through my discernment with your Holy Power.

I pray in mighty Yeshua's Name.

I love you.

Hallelujah!
"
title = "Prayer for Discernment"
